": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "name": "1 · Paper Delivery: the built paper, per version"}, {"id": "kept_s-ffd1beecf4ac", "type": "text", "x": 1475.0, "y": 452.5, "width": 1237.5000000000002, "height": 58.50000000000001, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-32bf9ba427a2", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "s03 · Paper Delivery: the built paper, per version", "originalText": "s03 · Paper Delivery: the built paper, per version", "fontSize": 45, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "kept_s-126da61a24ad", "type": "text", "x": 1475.0, "y": 577.5, "width": 1559.25, "height": 170.625, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-32bf9ba427a2", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "the paper Board's one `delivery/` (b10 s09-D05, s01-D32): each version's built paper sits under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/` (LaTeX, Word, cover letter), and each Section's own output under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/tNN_<section>/`. haipipe-paper-assemble builds the paper from the Sections' outputs;\nhaipipe-delivery owns the folder and the rule that only a person marks a send done. This topic settles what\npaper adds: the lanes a paper needs, how versions sit side by side, and what a send freezes.", "originalText": "the paper Board's one `delivery/` (b10 s09-D05, s01-D32): each version's built paper sits under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/` (LaTeX, Word, cover letter), and each Section's own output under\n`delivery/jNN_<version>/tNN_<section>/`. haipipe-paper-assemble builds the paper from the Sections' outputs;\nhaipipe-delivery owns the folder and the rule that only a person marks a send done. This topic settles what\npaper adds: the lanes a paper needs, how versions sit side by side, and what a send freezes.", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "kept_s-a1266ca7b89d", "type": "text", "x": 1475.0, "y": 977.5, "width": 115.5, "height": 39.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-32bf9ba427a2", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ON DISK", "originalText": "ON DISK", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.3}, {"id": "kept_s-cbc9d049c32a", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1475.0, "y": 1027.5, "width": 1375.0, "height": 375.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-32bf9ba427a2", "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "kept_s-2b5bf213ddd1", "type": "text", "x": 1505.0, "y": 1057.5, "width": 885.0, "height": 162.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "f